Package: hello-vyro
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sample GTK4 application using the Vyro design tokens
 hello-vyro is a small reference app that demonstrates the Vyro
 glassmorphism design system on a stock GTK4 widget tree. It is bundled
 with the Vyro OS Path A ISO as a starting point for developers building
 native Vyro apps.
